pocketmod.info.pocket.desc=A personal dimension of marble blocks with daylight. No summoning, plant growth or sleeping inside. Expand it by paying ingots at the border.
pocketmod.info.pocket.key=%s - enter and leave
pocketmod.info.pocket.l1=Enter and leave. Entering costs mana, leaving is free.
pocketmod.info.pocket.l2=Entering is %s%% cheaper.
pocketmod.info.teleport.desc=Instant jump to where you look. Price depends on distance. Needs a safe spot; does not work while in Spector.
pocketmod.info.teleport.key=%s - look teleport; hold - to the last totem
pocketmod.info.invis.desc=Hides you from mobs: they only notice you up close. Costs mana every second. Hitting breaks it for a few seconds, milk does not remove it.
pocketmod.info.invis.key=%s - on/off (hold - shop)
pocketmod.info.invis.l1=Mobs notice from %s blocks. Cost %s/s.
pocketmod.info.invis.l2=Mobs notice from %s blocks. Cost %s/s.
pocketmod.info.invis.l3=Mobs notice from %s blocks. Cost %s/s.
pocketmod.info.slow.desc=Slows the world, not you. The stronger the slowdown, the more mana per second.
pocketmod.info.slow.key=%s - on/off; hold it and scroll - slowdown strength
pocketmod.info.slow.l1=Slowdown down to x%s.
pocketmod.info.slow.l2=Slowdown down to x%s.
pocketmod.info.slow.l3=Full time stop (x0). Cost at zero %s/s.
pocketmod.info.decoy.desc=An addition to invisibility: a clone appears where you were and mobs switch to it. Hitting the clone or ending invisibility removes it.
pocketmod.info.decoy.key=Created automatically when invisibility turns on (%s)
pocketmod.info.decoy.l1=Clone lives up to %s s. One-time fee %s mana each time. Can be switched off.
pocketmod.info.spector.desc=Your spirit leaves the body and flies through walls while the body stays and mobs can see it. Damage to the body returns the spirit instantly. Cost grows with distance.
pocketmod.info.spector.key=%s (hold) - spirit; Shift+%s - phase step: the body moves to the spirit
pocketmod.info.spector.l1=Spirit and phase step (survival mode only).
pocketmod.info.thermal.desc=Outlines of living creatures through walls: enemies red, others white. Items are not highlighted, the world darkens.
pocketmod.info.thermal.key=%s - on/off
pocketmod.info.thermal.l1=Radius %s blocks, cost %s/s.
pocketmod.info.thermal.l2=Radius %s blocks, cost %s/s.
pocketmod.info.shield.desc=A mana dome: damage turns into mana cost. If mana runs out the shield turns off, you cannot die from it.
pocketmod.info.shield.key=%s - on/off
pocketmod.info.shield.l1=%s mana per 1 damage.
pocketmod.info.shield.l2=%s mana per 1 damage.
pocketmod.info.flight.desc=Double-tap jump in the air. Like creative but costs mana: no noclip, no instant mining, limited height and speed. Out of mana - soft hover.
pocketmod.info.flight.key=Double-tap jump in the air
pocketmod.info.flight.l1=Up to %s blocks above ground, speed x%s.
pocketmod.info.flight.l2=Up to %s blocks above ground, speed x%s.
pocketmod.info.flight.l3=Up to %s blocks above ground, speed x%s.
pocketmod.info.totem.desc=Saved teleport points with names. Marked in the world by a firefly and in JourneyMap. Creating, deleting and teleporting cost mana.
pocketmod.info.totem.key=Shift+%s - totem window; hold %s - to the last totem
pocketmod.info.totem.l1=%s slots.
pocketmod.info.totem.l2=%s slots, teleport %s%% cheaper.
pocketmod.info.totem.l3=%s slots, teleport %s%% cheaper.
pocketmod.info.softfall.desc=Passive: after a few blocks of falling the fall slows down and damage is absorbed. Costs mana while falling; out of mana - a normal fall.
pocketmod.info.softfall.key=Activates by itself; Space while falling toggles it off / on
pocketmod.info.softfall.l1=Triggers automatically after falling %s blocks, with a base drain of %s mana/s.
pocketmod.info.softfall.l2=Triggers automatically after falling %s blocks, with a base drain of %s mana/s.
pocketmod.msg.invis_broken=Invisibility broken by your hit for %s s (no mana is spent)
pocketmod.msg.invis_back=Invisibility is back
